sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as Blazor UI
    participant API as BFF API
    participant Slice as Feature Handler
    participant Store as Table Storage
    User->>UI: Submit action
    UI->>API: Same-origin request
    API->>API: Verify cookie
    API->>Slice: Run endpoint
    Slice->>Store: Read or write
    Store-->>Slice: Result
    Slice-->>UI: DTO
    UI-->>User: Updated screen
